  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Mais Digit@l for Guinea-Bissau</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Guinea-Bissau faces substantial challenges in its digital transformation, including limited institutional capacities, inadequate digital infrastructure, significant gender disparities in digital literacy and internet access, and underdeveloped regulatory frameworks. The country experiences low internet penetration, particularly among women, exacerbating existing economic and educational inequalities. The predominance of paper-based, in-person services and fragmented digital initiatives further h</narrative>
  </description>
